  "description": "Official client for InSight, Inventur Ltd's self-hosted observability platform. One call — services.AddInSight(configuration) — wires OpenTelemetry logs, metrics and traces with the OTLP/HTTP exporter pointed at your InSight ingest endpoint, attaches the per-service API key, sets the resource attributes, and self-registers the service's Service + App details on startup. Proprietary; see licence.",
